dure before handling drives"'::jsonb, '"Force connectors until they fit"'::jsonb, '"Touch contacts with a wet cloth"'::jsonb, '"The parallel port changes CPU instructions"'::jsonb, '"A dusty fan automatically increases disk capacity"'::jsonb, '"Restricted cooling can lead to overheating and protective shutdown"'::jsonb, '"The hard disk is converted to optical storage"'::jsonb, '"Printer cartridge colour"'::jsonb, '"Mouse sensor type"'::jsonb, '"Drive form factor, connector/interface, bay and power compatibility"'::jsonb, '"Wallpaper resolution"'::jsonb, '"Move it to a hard, unobstructed surface and check ventilation"'::jsonb, '"Increase CPU load further"'::jsonb, '"Format the storage drive"'::jsonb, '"Cover the remaining vents"'::jsonb, '"It is a type of optical storage"'::jsonb, '"It uses no contact with paper"'::jsonb, '"It produces output by changing monitor pixels"'::jsonb, '"Impact printing can make impressions through multi-part forms"'::jsonb, '"CPU clock and RAM capacity"'::jsonb, '"Number of pixels horizontally and vertically"'::jsonb, '"Physical size in inches"'::jsonb, '"Disk transfer rate and access time"'::jsonb, '"Compatibility, disk space, backups and boot configuration for both OS installations"'::jsonb, '"Changing the mouse buttons"'::jsonb, '"Formatting without identifying the disk"'::jsonb, '"Removing the power supply fan"'::jsonb, '"Speaker impedance only"'::jsonb, '"Data transfer rate"'::jsonb, '"Keyboard switch travel"'::jsonb, '"Display resolution"'::jsonb, '"Keyboard switch type"'::jsonb, '"Optical-disc label"'::jsonb, '"Printer ribbon"'::jsonb, '"Graphics card/graphics subsystem"'::jsonb, '"Inkjet printer"'::jsonb, '"Daisy-wheel impact printer"'::jsonb, '"Mechanical keyboard"'::jsonb, '"Dot-matrix impact printer"'::jsonb, '"Format the drive attached to the port"'::jsonb, '"Check for damage/connection issues and test the affected port with a known-good device"'::jsonb, '"Change the display resolution"'::jsonb, '"Swap the printer ink type"'::jsonb, '"Replace the keyboard"'::jsonb, '"Clean the LCD panel"'::jsonb, '"Change the desktop theme"'::jsonb, '"Check device/BIOS detection and then confirm disk initialization, partitioning and formatting as appropriate"'::jsonb, '"Change keyboard keycaps"'::jsonb, '"Reinstall every application"'::jsonb, '"Check cable/connector seating and firmware detection, then examine OS disk initialization"'::jsonb, '"Replace the monitor first"'::jsonb, '"Outlet, power cable and PSU switch/connection"'::jsonb, '"Printer paper size"'::jsonb, '"HDD partition label"'::jsonb, '"Mouse acceleration"'::jsonb, '"Replace monitor resolution"'::jsonb, '"Install a second hard drive after checking compatibility and power/data connections"'::jsonb, '"Change keyboard layout"'::jsonb, '"Swap mouse buttons"'::jsonb, '"Delete every partition"'::jsonb, '"Initialize immediately because detection proves it is empty"'::jsonb, '"Create new partitions without checking"'::jsonb, '"Stop and verify ownership/contents and backup before initializing or formatting"'::jsonb, '"Back up and verify the target drive and partition before making changes"'::jsonb, '"Delete the backup to avoid confusion"'::jsonb, '"Format every drive first"'::jsonb, '"Select a partition by capacity alone without checking"'::jsonb, '"Check only the colour of the card"'::jsonb, '"Assume all cards use the same slot"'::jsonb, '"Check that the card''s slot/interface and physical size are compatible with the motherboard and case"'::jsonb, '"Choose the widest connector regardless of fit"'::jsonb, '"Whether the monitor brightness is high enough"'::jsonb, '"Whether a keyboard uses rubber domes"'::jsonb, '"Whether a DVD is writable"'::jsonb, '"Whether a suitable compatible interface/adapter and driver are supported"'::jsonb, '"Keyboard controller"'::jsonb, '"Graphics card"'::jsonb, '"Optical drive tray"'::jsonb, '"Battery"'::jsonb, '"Change screen resolution only"'::jsonb, '"Change the desktop wallpaper"'::jsonb, '"Verify the adapter, charging connector and battery condition using the device''s service guidance"'::jsonb, '"Clean the printer ribbon"'::jsonb, '"Check monitor power, selected input and video cable seating"'::jsonb, '"Replace all RAM without inspection"'::jsonb, '"Install a second operating system"'::jsonb, '"Reformat the disk immediately"'::jsonb, '"Install a second HDD"'::jsonb, '"Inspect the internal display brightness/output selection and panel connection with appropriate service precautions"'::jsonb, '"Replace all USB devices"'::jsonb, '"Format all drives"'::jsonb, '"Swap the CPU socket"'::jsonb, '"Change the HDD partition label"'::jsonb, '"Inspect ink levels and printhead/nozzle condition"'::jsonb, '"Change the mouse interface"'::jsonb, '"Loose or damaged video cable/connector"'::jsonb, '"Wrong keyboard layout"'::jsonb, '"Incorrect document margins"'::jsonb, '"Full optical disc"'::jsonb, '"Capacity and transfer rate are identical"'::jsonb, '"A keyboard switch sets the drive speed"'::jsonb, '"Capacity is amount stored; transfer rate is speed of data movement"'::jsonb, '"Resolution determines disk speed"'::jsonb, '"An HDD is an input peripheral"'::jsonb, '"An HDD uses magnetic storage; a flash drive uses flash memory"'::jsonb, '"A flash drive is a display technology"'::jsonb, '"Both always use spinning platters"'::jsonb, '"Display of pixels on a panel"'::jsonb, '"Ink sprayed through nozzles"'::jsonb, '"Laser reading from a disc"'::jsonb, '"Impact printing with formed characters on a wheel"'::jsonb, '"Connector/interface and system compatibility"'::jsonb, '"Whether the printer uses a ribbon"'::jsonb, '"Whether the hard disk uses optical storage"'::jsonb, '"Whether the monitor is CRT"'::jsonb, '"Format the hard drive"'::jsonb, '"Power down and reseat the compatible module in the specified slot; verify compatibility"'::jsonb, '"Change the monitor''s aspect ratio"'::jsonb, '"Reinstall the printer driver"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1':